  "20": {
   "payload": {
    "zoneHTML": "<div class=\"ace-line\" data-node=\"true\" dir=\"auto\"><span data-string=\"true\" style=\"font-weight:bold;\" class=\" author-7076000738450669572 textHighlight textHighlight-pink-text textHighlight-ccmtoken-doc-textcolor-red text-highlight-background text-highlight-background-yellow-light-bg\" data-leaf=\"true\">year</span><span data-string=\"true\" data-enter=\"true\" data-leaf=\"true\">​</span></div>"
   },
   "type": "text"
  },
  "21": {
   "payload": {
    "zoneHTML": "<div class=\"ace-line\" data-node=\"true\" dir=\"auto\"><span data-string=\"true\" class=\" author-7076000738450669572\" data-leaf=\"true\">统一大小写保护，直接复制下来的bib会把原本应该大写的自动变成小写，需要使用</span><span data-string=\"true\" class=\" author-7076000738450669572 textHighlight textHighlight-pink-text textHighlight-ccmtoken-doc-textcolor-red text-highlight-background text-highlight-background-yellow-light-bg\" data-leaf=\"true\"> </span><span data-string=\"true\" style=\"font-weight:bold;\" class=\" author-7076000738450669572 textHighlight textHighlight-pink-text textHighlight-ccmtoken-doc-textcolor-red text-highlight-background text-highlight-background-yellow-light-bg\" data-leaf=\"true\">{} </span><span data-string=\"true\" class=\" author-7076000738450669572\" data-leaf=\"true\">保护。</span><span data-string=\"true\" data-enter=\"true\" data-leaf=\"true\">​</span></div>"
   },
   "type": "ordered"
  },
  "22": {
   "payload": {
    "zoneHTML": "<div class=\"ace-line\" data-node=\"true\" dir=\"auto\"><span data-string=\"true\" class=\" author-7076000738450669572\" data-leaf=\"true\">例如，</span><span data-string=\"true\" class=\" author-7076000738450669572 textHighlight textHighlight-blue-text textHighlight-ccmtoken-doc-textcolor-blue\" data-leaf=\"true\">title={</span><span data-string=\"true\" class=\" author-7076000738450669572 textHighlight textHighlight-pink-text textHighlight-ccmtoken-doc-textcolor-red\" data-leaf=\"true\">{</span><span data-string=\"true\" class=\" author-7076000738450669572 textHighlight textHighlight-blue-text textHighlight-ccmtoken-doc-textcolor-blue\" data-leaf=\"true\">SymSkill</span><span data-string=\"true\" class=\" author-7076000738450669572 textHighlight textHighlight-pink-text textHighlight-ccmtoken-doc-textcolor-red\" data-leaf=\"true\">}</span><span data-string=\"true\" class=\" author-7076000738450669572 textHighlight textHighlight-blue-text textHighlight-ccmtoken-doc-textcolor-blue\" data-leaf=\"true\">: Symbol and Skill Co-Invention for Data-Efficient Robot Learning}，</span><span data-string=\"true\" class=\" author-7076000738450669572\" data-leaf=\"true\">如果不加{}就会全都变成小写。对于论文标题、或者一些常见的名字，例如LLM、GPT等，都需要使用大写保护，例如：</span><span data-string=\"true\" data-enter=\"true\" data-leaf=\"true\">​</span></div>"
   },
   "type": "text"
  },
  "23": {
   "payload": {
    "zoneHTML": "<div class=\"ace-line\" data-node=\"true\" dir=\"auto\"><span data-string=\"true\" data-leaf=\"true\">代码块</span><span data-string=\"true\" data-enter=\"true\" data-leaf=\"true\">​</span></div>"
   },
   "type": "code"
  },
  "24": {
   "payload": {
    "zoneHTML": "<div class=\"ace-line\" data-node=\"true\" dir=\"auto\"><span data-string=\"true\" class=\" author-7076000738450669572\" data-leaf=\"true\">关于Author：除非作者太多的情况，建议保留所有作者，如果作者实在太多，可以用et al.,代替，作者名称可以保留DBLP导出的作者格式，不需要改写</span><span data-string=\"true\" data-enter=\"true\" data-leaf=\"true\">​</span></div>"
   },
   "type": "ordered"
  },
  "25": {
   "payload": {
    "zoneHTML": "<div class=\"ace-line\" data-node=\"true\" dir=\"auto\"><span data-string=\"true\" class=\" author-7076000738450669572\" data-leaf=\"true\">关于booktitle / journal：</span><span data-string=\"true\" data-enter=\"true\" data-leaf=\"true\">​</span></div>"
   },
   "type": "ordered"
  },
  "26": {
   "payload": {
    "zoneHTML": "<div class=\"ace-line\" data-node=\"true\" dir=\"auto\"><span data-string=\"true\" style=\"font-weight:bold;\" class=\" author-7076000738450669572 textHighlight textHighlight-pink-text textHighlight-ccmtoken-doc-textcolor-red text-highlight-background text-highlight-background-yellow-light-bg\" data-leaf=\"true\">确保在参考文献中，同一个会议的引用，格式完全一致，不要有的用全称，有的用缩写；有的首字母大写，有的不大写等等。</span><span data-string=\"true\" data-enter=\"true\" data-leaf=\"true\">​</span></div>"
   },
   "type": "ordered"
  },
  "27": {
   "payload": {
    "zoneHTML": "<div class=\"ace-line\" data-node=\"true\" dir=\"auto\"><span data-string=\"true\" class=\" author-7076000738450669572\" data-leaf=\"true\">对于大部分会议，都应该写成如下形式，</span><span data-string=\"true\" style=\"font-weight:bold;\" class=\" author-7076000738450669572 textHighlight textHighlight-pink-text textHighlight-ccmtoken-doc-textcolor-red text-highlight-background text-highlight-background-yellow-light-bg\" data-leaf=\"true\">Proceedings of   the xxth International Conference on Machine Learning。需要注意：</span><span data-string=\"true\" data-enter=\"true\" data-leaf=\"true\">​</span></div>"
   },
   "type": "ordered"
  },
  "28": {
   "payload": {
    "zoneHTML": "<div class=\"ace-line\" data-node=\"true\" dir=\"auto\"><span data-string=\"true\" style=\"font-weight:bold;\" class=\" author-7076000738450669572 textHighlight textHighlight-pink-text textHighlight-ccmtoken-doc-textcolor-red text-highlight-background text-highlight-background-yellow-light-bg\" data-leaf=\"true\">届数用数字表示，注意序数词不要用错，1st, 2nd, 3rd, 4th, 5th……</span><span data-string=\"true\" data-enter=\"true\" data-leaf=\"true\">​</span></div>"
   },
   "type": "ordered"
  },
  "29": {
   "payload": {
    "zoneHTML": "<div class=\"ace-line\" data-node=\"true\" dir=\"auto\"><span data-string=\"true\" style=\"font-weight:bold;\" class=\" author-7076000738450669572 textHighlight textHighlight-pink-text textHighlight-ccmtoken-doc-textcolor-red text-highlight-background text-highlight-background-yellow-light-bg\" data-leaf=\"true\">有些特殊会议没有届数而是年份，保证同一个会议的引用格式一致即可，例如：</span><span data-string=\"true\" data-enter=\"true\" data-leaf=\"true\">​</span></div>"
   },
   "type": "ordered"
  },
  "30": {
   "payload": {
    "zoneHTML": "<div class=\"ace-line\" data-node=\"true\" dir=\"auto\"><span data-string=\"true\" style=\"font-weight:bold;\" class=\" author-7076000738450669572 textHighlight textHighlight-pink-text textHighlight-ccmtoken-doc-textcolor-red text-highlight-background text-highlight-background-yellow-light-bg\" data-leaf=\"true\">EMLNP：{Proceedings of the 2024 Conference on Empirical Methods in Natural Language Processing}</span><span data-string=\"true\" data-enter=\"true\" data-leaf=\"true\">​</span></div>"
   },
   "type": "ordered"
  },
  "31": {
   "payload": {
    "zoneHTML": "<div class=\"ace-line\" data-node=\"true\" dir=\"auto\"><span data-string=\"true\" style=\"font-weight:bold;\" class=\" author-7076000738450669572 textHighlight textHighlight-pink-text textHighlight-ccmtoken-doc-textcolor-red text-highlight-background text-highlight-background-yellow-light-bg\" data-leaf=\"true\">CVPR:  booktitle =  {Proceedings of the IEEE/CVF Conference on Computer Vision and Pattern Recognition}</span><span data-string=\"true\" data-enter=\"true\" data-leaf=\"true\">​</span></div>"
   },
   "type": "ordered"
  },
  "32": {
   "payload": {
    "zoneHTML": "<div class=\"ace-line\" data-node=\"true\" dir=\"auto\"><span data-string=\"true\" class=\" author-7076000738450669572\" data-leaf=\"true\">部分会议没有Proceedings，保证同一个会议格式一致即可，例如</span><span data-string=\"true\" data-enter=\"true\" data-leaf=\"true\">​</span></div>"
   },
   "type": "ordered"
  },
  "33": {
   "payload": {
    "zoneHTML": "<div class=\"ace-line\" data-node=\"true\" dir=\"auto\"><span data-string=\"true\" style=\"font-weight:bold;\" class=\" author-7076000738450669572 textHighlight textHighlight-pink-text textHighlight-ccmtoken-doc-textcolor-red text-highlight-background text-highlight-background-yellow-light-bg\" data-leaf=\"true\">NeurIPS： booktitle = {Advances in Neural Information Processing Systems}（注意很多时候NeurIPS引用后面会有一个数字，例如</span><span class=\"outer-u-container docx-outer-link-container\" data-inline-wrapper=\"true\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\" class=\" author-7076000738450669572 link-wrapper link-text-color link-start link-end link-id-33-0-1 textHighlight textHighlight-pink-text textHighlight-ccmtoken-doc-textcolor-red text-highlight-background text-highlight-background-yellow-light-bg\" data-leaf=\"true\"><a style=\"cursor:pointer;text-decoration-skip:none;\" class=\"link contextmenu-without-copyperm\" href=\"https://proceedings.neurips.cc/paper_files/paper/2021\" data-href=\"https%3A%2F%2Fproceedings.neurips.cc%2Fpaper_files%2Fpaper%2F2021\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" data-link-node=\"true\"><span data-string=\"true\">Advances in Neural Information Processing Systems 34</span></a></span></span><span data-string=\"true\" style=\"font-weight:bold;\" class=\" author-7076000738450669572 textHighlight textHighlight-pink-text textHighlight-ccmtoken-doc-textcolor-red text-highlight-background text-highlight-background-yellow-light-bg\" data-leaf=\"true\">，34这种数字删掉）</span><span data-string=\"true\" data-enter=\"true\" data-leaf=\"true\">​</span></div>"
   },
   "type": "ordered"
  },
  "34": {
   "payload": {
    "zoneHTML": "<div class=\"ace-line\" data-node=\"true\" dir=\"auto\"><span data-string=\"true\" style=\"font-weight:bold;\" class=\" author-7076000738450669572 textHighlight textHighlight-pink-text textHighlight-ccmtoken-doc-textcolor-red text-highlight-background text-highlight-background-yellow-light-bg\" data-leaf=\"true\">会议名称首字母都改为大写</span><span data-string=\"true\" data-enter=\"true\" data-leaf=\"true\">​</span></div>"
   },
   "type": "ordered"
  },
  "35": {
   "payload": {
    "zoneHTML": "<div class=\"ace-line\" data-node=\"true\" dir=\"auto\"><span data-string=\"true\" class=\" author-7076000738450669572\" data-leaf=\"true\">Volume/Number：对于期刊引用，需要有准确的期卷号，例如：</span><span data-string=\"true\" data-enter=\"true\" data-leaf=\"true\">​</span></div>"
   },
   "type": "ordered"
  },
  "36": {
   "payload": {
    "zoneHTML": "<div class=\"ace-line\" data-node=\"true\" dir=\"auto\"><span data-string=\"true\" data-leaf=\"true\">代码块</span><span data-string=\"true\" data-enter=\"true\" data-leaf=\"true\">​</span></div>"
